%% Phase4 / search / MV3-G14c 跨会话消息搜索并分组
%% 机器真源: cses-client phase4.manifest.json；Helix im_search_do；Java /search/do；Angular historical-records search window
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant UI as HistoricalRecordsSearchWindow
  participant P as MessageV3ImGate
  participant T as Tauri im_search_do
  participant H as Helix Tick / search outbound
  participant J as Java search gateway
  participant B as EventSink im:__bus__
  participant S as Angular grouped result signal
  UI->>P: searchMessagesGrouped(keyword,limit)
  P->>T: invoke im_search_do
  T->>H: Tick::Command(im_search_do, req_id)
  H->>J: Effect::Http POST /search/do
  J-->>H: channelId,channel,items
  H->>H: Tick::PortReply(Http Ok) / validate and correlate
  H->>B: Effect::Emit im:read:result(req_id,data)
  B->>S: group by channelId, retain createAt order
  S->>UI: grouped list and target-message navigation
  Note over H,B: 无匹配返回空集合；只读链没有 PersistOk 或 WS 终态
